---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy" path="/privacy/" description="What Xoddam the Mighty collects, and what stays on your device.">
  <main>
    <article class="card">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated {SITE.updated}.</em></p>

      <h2>The game</h2>
      <p>
        The game does not ask for your name, an email address or any account. Your progress and your settings (sound,
        zoom) are saved in your own browser, on your own device. We never receive them. If you clear your browser's
        site data, the saved game is gone.
      </p>

      <h2>Counting visits</h2>
      <p>
        This site and the game page use Google Analytics to count visits: which pages are opened, roughly where in the
        world a visit comes from, what kind of device and browser it is, and how people found the site. Google
        Analytics uses cookies to do this. We use these numbers only to see how many people visit and which pages
        work, not for advertising.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can stop it by blocking cookies in your browser, with a content blocker, or with
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google's opt-out browser add-on</a>. The game works the
        same without it.
      </p>

      <h2>The Android app</h2>
      <p>
        The Android app is the same game in a package. It has no internet permission and sends nothing anywhere. Its
        saved game stays on the tablet.
      </p>

      <h2>Fonts and pictures</h2>
      <p>The site's fonts and pictures are served from this site itself, not from another company's servers.</p>

      <p><a href="/">Back to the game</a></p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
</style>
